-# Benchmark research validation
-
-Structured-reference research records share the candidate bank's ASCII benchmark identifier format.
-
-Research source metadata is limited to publicly auditable web pages. The model rejects non-public host forms and URLs carrying embedded account data. Source bytes and local locations stay outside Git, and source discovery does not satisfy the separate human acceptance gate.
