-  → choose folder containing IMG_4388.jpeg ... IMG_4402.jpeg
-  → movement = prelude
-  → Recognize page 2 (5 systems, first 8 measures)
-  → Review/correct every measure
-  → export reviewed fixture at chosen BPM
